<title>UK: DANISCO TO BUY BORTHWICKS.</title>
<headline>DANISCO TO BUY BORTHWICKS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's Danisco A/S said on Friday it would buy Borthwicks Plc, in an agreed deal valuing the British food and drinks flavourings firm at about 36.6 million stg cash.  </p>
<p>The offer valued each Borthwicks share at 63p, the companies said in a joint statement released here.</p>
<p>Borthwicks' shares surged 17.5p to 61.5 at 1215 GMT.</p>
<p>With manufacturing operations in Britain and the U.S., Borthwicks had pretax profits of 1.5 million stg on turnover of 31.9 million stg for the year to March 29.</p>
<p>Danisco is an international supplier of sweeteners, food ingredients and packaging.</p>
